            "markup": "\u003Cp\u003EThis article shares my experience of building my first Umbraco package during the Umbraco Spark hackathon. Inspired by an idea from a PM at true, I set out to extend the Rich Text Editor with a Lorem Ipsum dropdown, making it simple to insert placeholder text directly into RTE blocks.\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022https://24days.in/umbraco-cms/2025/creating-lorem-ipsum-generator/\u0022 target=\u0022_blank\u0022 rel=\u0022noopener\u0022\u003ERead the original article\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/p\u003E"
